# Dev commands

All run from `codex-rs/` unless noted.

## Build and run

```bash
just codex -- "explain this codebase"   # cargo run --bin sakrylle
just exec "do something"                 # non-interactive mode
cargo build
```

## Format and lint

```bash
just fmt
just fmt-check
just fix -p <crate>
just clippy -p <crate>
just argument-comment-lint
```

## Tests

```bash
just test -p <crate>                     # prefer scoped tests
just test                                # full suite — ask before running
just bench-smoke
cargo insta pending-snapshots -p codex-tui
cargo insta accept -p codex-tui
```

## Schema and codegen

```bash
just write-config-schema
just write-app-server-schema
just write-app-server-schema --experimental
just write-hooks-schema
```

## Dependencies and other

```bash
just bazel-lock-update                   # after Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock changes
just bazel-lock-check
just install
just mcp-server-run
just log
```
